NOTE:
	findExternalComptimeFunction() currently uses the local declaration name to match the manifest. 
	That handles your signal export and the current manifest format. For more general support of 
	renamed exports, multiple public exports pointing to the same declaration, and package subpath exports, 
	the manifest should eventually record the public export name separately from the local declaration name and source path.